age, and the target is {@condition grappled} (escape {@dc 13}). Until this grapple ends, the target is {@condition restrained}, and the yuan-ti can''t constrict another target."]}, {"name": "Scimitar (Yuan-ti Form Only)", "entries": ["{@atk mw} {@hit 5} to hit, reach 5 ft., one target. {@h}6 ({@damage 1d6 + 3}) slashing damage."]}, {"name": "Longbow (Yuan-ti Form Only)", "entries": ["{@atk rw} {@hit 4} to hit, range 150/600 ft., one target. {@h}6 ({@damage 1d8 + 2}) piercing damage."]}]', '[]', '[]', '["forest", "swamp", "desert"]');
INSERT INTO monsters (id, name, type, subtype, size, alignment, armor_class, hit_points, speed, strength, dexterity, constitution, intelligence, wisdom, charisma, challenge_rating, experience_points, proficiency_bonus, saving_throws, skills, damage_resistances, damage_immunities, condition_immunities, senses, languages, special_abilities, actions, legendary_actions, reactions, environment) VALUES ('yuan-ti_pureblood', 'Yuan-ti Pureblood', 'humanoid', 'yuan-ti', 'M', 'N, E', 11, 40, '{"walk": 30}', 11, 12, 11, 13, 12, 14, '1', 0, 2, '{}', '{"deception": "+6", "perception": "+3", "stealth": "+3"}', '[]', '[]', '[]', '["darkvision 60 ft."]', '["Abyssal", "Common", "Draconic"]', '[{"name": "Magic Resistance", "entries": ["The yuan-ti has advantage on saving throws against spells and other magical effects."]}]', '[{"name": "Multiattack", "entries": ["The yuan-ti makes two melee attacks."]}, {"name": "Scimitar", "entries": ["{@atk mw} {@hit 3} to hit, reach 5 ft., one target. {@h}4 ({@damage 1d6 + 1}) slashing damage."]}, {"name": "Shortbow", "entries": ["{@atk rw} {@hit 3} to hit, range 80/320 ft., one target. {@h}4 ({@damage 1d6 + 1}) piercing damage plus 7 ({@damage 2d6}) poison damage."]}]', '[]', '[]', '["forest", "swamp", "urban", "desert"]');
INSERT INTO monsters (id, name, type, subtype, size, alignment, armor_class, hit_points, speed, strength, dexterity, constitution, intelligence, wisdom, charisma, challenge_rating, experience_points, proficiency_bonus, saving_throws, skills, damage_resistances, damage_immunities, condition_immunities, senses, languages, special_abilities, actions, legendary_actions, reactions, environment) VALUES ('zombie', 'Zombie', 'undead', '', 'M', 'N, E', 8, 22, '{"walk": 20}', 13, 6, 16, 3, 6, 5, '1/4', 0, 2, '{"wis": "+0"}', '{}', '[]', '[]', '[]', '["darkvision 60 ft."]', '["understands all languages it spoke in life but can''t speak"]', '[{"name": "Undead Fortitude", "entries": ["If damage reduces the zombie to 0 hit points, it must make a Constitution saving throw with a DC of 5 + the damage taken, unless the damage is radiant or from a critical hit. On a success, the zombie drops to 1 hit point instead."]}]', '[{"name": "Slam", "entries": ["{@atk mw} {@hit 3} to hit, reach 5 ft., one target. {@h}4 ({@damage 1d6 + 1}) bludgeoning damage."]}]', '[]', '[]', '["urban"]');
INSERT INTO monsters (id, name, type, subtype, size, alignment, armor_class, hit_points, speed, strength, dexterity, constitution, intelligence, wisdom, charisma, challenge_rating, experience_points, proficiency_bonus, saving_throws, skills, damage_resistances, damage_immunities, condition_immunities, senses, languages, special_abilities, actions, legendary_actions, reactions, environment) VALUES ('minotaur_of_baphomet', 'Minotaur of Baphomet', 'monstrosity', '', 'L', 'C, E', 14, 85, '{"walk": 40}', 18, 11, 16, 6, 16, 9, '3', 700, 2, '{}', '{"perception": "+7", "survival": "+7"}', '[]', '[]', '[]', '["darkvision 60 ft."]', '["Abyssal"]', '[]', '[{"name": "Abyssal Glaive", "entries": ["Melee Attack Roll: +6, reach 10 ft. Hit: 10 (1d12 + 4) Slashing damage plus 10 (3d6) Necrotic damage."]}, {"name": "Gore (Recharge 5-6)", "entries": ["Melee Attack Roll: +6, reach 5 ft. Hit: 18 (4d6 + 4) Piercing damage. If the target is a Large or smaller creature and the minotaur moved 10+ feet straight toward it immediately before the hit, the target takes an extra 10 (3d6) Piercing damage and has the Prone condition."]}]', '[]', '[]', '[]');
INSERT INTO monsters (id, name, type, subtype, size, alignment, armor_class, hit_points, speed, strength, dexterity, constitution, intelligence, wisdom, charisma, challenge_rating, experience_points, proficiency_bonus, saving_throws, skills, damage_resistances, damage_immunities, condition_immunities, senses, languages, special_abilities, actions, legendary_actions, reactions, environment) VALUES ('will_o_wisp', 'Will-o''-Wisp', 'undead', '', 'T', 'C, E', 19, 27, '{"walk": 5, "fly": 50}', 1, 28, 10, 13, 14, 11, '2', 450, 2, '{}', '{}', '["Acid", "Bludgeoning", "Cold", "Fire", "Necrotic", "Piercing", "Slashing"]', '["Lightning", "Poison"]', '["Exhaustion", "Grappled", "Paralyzed", "Petrified", "Poisoned", "Prone", "Restrained", "Unconscious"]', '["darkvision 120 ft."]', '["Common plus one other"]', '[{"name": "Ephemeral", "entries": ["The wisp can''t wear or carry anything."]}, {"name": "Illumination", "entries": ["The wisp sheds Bright Light in a 20-foot radius and Dim Light for an additional 20 feet."]}, {"name": "Incorporeal Movement", "entries": ["The wisp can move through other creatures and objects as if they were Difficult Terrain. It takes 5 (1d10) Force damage if it ends its turn inside an object."]}]', '[{"name": "Shock", "entries": ["Melee Attack Roll: +4, reach 5 ft. Hit: 11 (2d8 + 2) Lightning damage."]}, {"name": "Consume Life (Bonus Action)", "entries": ["Constitution Saving Throw: DC 10, one living creature the wisp can see within 5 feet that has 0 Hit Points."]}]', '[]', '[]', '[]');
